	(text "SENSOR HEAD (own board, same panel). Perfboard charge amp (TRL3): piezo -> summing node HSUM, Rf 1M || Cf 47 pF, Rs 49.9R. Runs from 5 V through the coax (L1), signal returns through C38."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 360 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "56eb8715-b0df-4280-b2e3-f379367e2cd0")
	)
	(text "Single OPA365 (same die as the OPA2365 on the main board), VREF = 5 V / 2 = 2.5 V (10k/10k + 10 uF), all 0402. Head ground is HGND (a separate board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 366 0)
		(effects
